  "description": "The CGR Ti 105 Di2 is a highly versatile, do-it-all bike built for year-round riding on smooth tarmac, rough lanes and gravel trails alike. Its titanium frame delivers the smooth ride quality and durability the material is known for, helping take the edge off rough surfaces while staying lively when you pick up the pace. It pairs fast, precise Shimano Di2 12-speed Di2 electronic shifting with dependable Mavic Allroad 1 wheels and fast-rolling 40 mm Schwalbe G-One Allround tyres. Finished with a comfortable Selle Italia X3 saddle, the CGR Ti 105 Di2 is ready for everything from daily commutes to long gravel adventures.",
